      value: Enemy Variant 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2669403751693617808, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Sprite
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -66252384, guid: afdea11b6efe54b4d9a06c7962c1e68c, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: ArmEnemy
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 4637487863188967067}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: enemyLifeBar
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 3442414154181359129}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueDuration
      value: 10
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: randomPhrases.Array.data[0]
      value: A patrulha esta tranquila, nenhum inimigo a vista.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: randomPhrases.Array.data[4]
      value: Esta frio aqui fora, vamos terminar rapido.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: randomPhrases.Array.data[5]
      value: "Parece que eles n\xE3o estao nesta area."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: randomPhrases.Array.data[6]
      value: Devemos estar atentos, algo nao parece certo.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: randomPhrases.Array.data[7]
      value: Espero que o cafe ainda esteja quente no acampamento.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: randomPhrases.Array.data[9]
      value: Este silencio e perturbador.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: randomPhrases.Array.data[10]
      value: Nao ouco nada ha horas, sera um bom sinal?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: randomPhrases.Array.data[11]
      value: Fiquem juntos, nao se dispersem!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: randomPhrases.Array.data[14]
      value: Se encontrarmos algo, espero que nao seja uma bomba.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: randomPhrases.Array.data[16]
      value: Espero que o proximo grupo assuma logo.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: randomPhrases.Array.data[17]
      value: Acho que ouvi algo... Ah, so o vento.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312858954927100593, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: randomPhrases.Array.data[19]
      value: Nada para relatar, capitao.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6819347321899589040, guid: b833d4edaf959d14488a0606779e6af1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
